# Agent Orchestration Policy

- Skills and plugins are opt-in only.
- Do not auto-use newly added skills or plugins.
- Keep execution in default direct mode unless user intent explicitly calls for optional orchestration.
- This includes optional plugins such as `caveman`, `lean-ctx`, and `symdex`.
- If user intent is ambiguous, ask before enabling optional skills/plugins.
